        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Last Shot with Judge Gunn\n- People: Mary Ann Gunn, Matt Battaglia, Peter Brennan, George Jones, Lisa Lew, Justin Page, Terry Powell\n- Companies: Trifecta Entertainment\n- Topics: Television syndication, television production roles\n\nFacts:\n- Last Shot with Judge Gunn debuted in American television syndication on September 26, 2011.\n- Last Shot with Judge Gunn is an American reality-based nontraditional court show.\n- Matt Battaglia was born on September 25, 1965.\n- Matt Battaglia is an Emmy-winning producer, an American actor, and a former American football player.\n- Last Shot with Judge Gunn is presented by Mary Ann Gunn.\n- Trifecta Entertainment distributed Last Shot with Judge Gunn.\n- Peter Brennan, Matt Battaglia, and George Jones served as executive producers of Last Shot with Judge Gunn.\n- Lisa Lew was the co-executive producer of Last Shot with Judge Gunn.\n- Justin Page and Terry Powell were supervising producers of Last Shot with Judge Gunn.",
